{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34434","headline":"和袭美赠南阳润卿将归雷平 · 陆龟蒙","name":"和袭美赠南阳润卿将归雷平","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝市山林隐一般，却归那减卧云懽。\n堕阶红叶谁收得，半盎清醪客酹乾。\n玉笈诗成吟处晓，金沙泉落梦中寒。\n真仙若降如相问，曾步星罡绕醮坛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34434.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34434","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}